{"id": "3129425", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3129425", "title": "Fels\u0151-kiskuns\u00e1gi szikes puszt\u00e1k \u00e9s turj\u00e1nvid\u00e9k", "text": "Fels\u0151-kiskuns\u00e1gi szikes puszt\u00e1k \u00e9s turj\u00e1nvid\u00e9k este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Ungaria \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului Fels\u0151-kiskuns\u00e1gi szikes puszt\u00e1k \u00e9s turj\u00e1nvid\u00e9k este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul Fels\u0151-kiskuns\u00e1gi szikes puszt\u00e1k \u00e9s turj\u00e1nvid\u00e9k a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 77 de specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunea panonic\u0103, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (77): privighetoare-de-balt\u0103 (\"Acrocephalus melanopogon\"), ra\u021b\u0103 lingurar (\"Anas clypeata\"), ra\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anas platyrhynchos\"), ra\u021b\u0103 c\u00e2r\u00e2itoare (\"Anas querquedula\"), ra\u021b\u0103 pestri\u021b\u0103 (\"Anas strepera\"), g\u00e2rli\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anser albifrons\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 cenu\u0219ie (\"Anser anser\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 de sem\u0103n\u0103tur\u0103 (\"Anser fabalis\"), f\u00e2s\u0103-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Anthus campestris\"), acvil\u0103 de c\u00e2mp (\"Aquila heliaca\"), st\u00e2rc ro\u0219u (\"Ardea purpurea\"), st\u00e2rc galben (\"Ardeola ralloides\"), ciuf de c\u00e2mp (\"Asio flammeus\"), ra\u021b\u0103 ro\u0219ie (\"Aythya nyroca\"), buhai de balt\u0103 (\"Botaurus stellaris\"), g\u00e2sca cu piept ro\u0219u (\"Branta ruficollis\"), pas\u0103rea ogorului (\"Burhinus oedicnemus\"), \u0219orecar mare (\"Buteo rufinus\"), caprimulg (\"Caprimulgus europaeus\"), prund\u0103ra\u0219 de s\u0103r\u0103tur\u0